@startuml student_invitation_flow
title Add Student by Invitation - UML Sequence Diagram

hide footbox

actor Tutor
participant API
participant InviteStudentHandler
participant AcceptStudentInvitationHandler
database Database
actor Student

Tutor -> API: POST /api/tutors/me/student-invitations
API -> InviteStudentHandler: InviteStudentCommand
InviteStudentHandler -> Database: Check active agreement for Tutor+Recipient
InviteStudentHandler -> InviteStudentHandler: Generate raw token + TokenHash
InviteStudentHandler -> Database: Save StudentInvitation (TokenHash only)
InviteStudentHandler --> API: InvitationUrl (raw token)
API --> Tutor: 200 OK + invitation link

Tutor -> Student: Share invitation link (out of band)

Student -> API: POST /api/student-invitations/{token}/accept
API -> AcceptStudentInvitationHandler: AcceptStudentInvitationCommand
AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> Database: Find StudentInvitation by TokenHash
AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> AcceptStudentInvitationHandler: Validate ValidUntilUtc, Status, recipient email
AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> Database: Check active agreement for Tutor+Student
AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> Database: Create TutoringAgreement, mark invitation Accepted
AcceptStudentInvitationHandler --> API: AgreementId
API --> Student: 200 OK

@enduml
